1
00:00:20,280 --> 00:00:21,720
Congratulations, Shen Xi.

2
00:00:21,720 --> 00:00:22,780
You danced so well.

3
00:00:22,960 --> 00:00:24,840
The championship is definitely yours.

4
00:00:24,840 --> 00:00:26,880
Yeah, no wonder you're back from Beijing.

5
00:00:26,880 --> 00:00:28,360
It's a total mismatch.

6
00:00:28,360 --> 00:00:30,020
Congratulations in advance.

7
00:00:30,160 --> 00:00:30,840
Thank you.

8
00:00:31,320 --> 00:00:33,280
You're flattering me.

9
00:00:33,560 --> 00:00:35,880
I'll treat you to dinner after the finals.

10
00:00:35,880 --> 00:00:36,640
Great.

11
00:00:36,840 --> 00:00:38,200
We'll go change first.

12
00:00:38,680 --> 00:00:39,040
Okay.

13
00:00:52,440 --> 00:00:55,040
Ms. Shen, you truly
live up to your reputation.

14
00:00:58,560 --> 00:00:59,840
Congratulations.

15
00:00:59,880 --> 00:01:00,880
Excellent results.

16
00:01:00,880 --> 00:01:02,160
Truly well-deserved.

17
00:01:04,760 --> 00:01:05,480
Thank you.

18
00:01:06,840 --> 00:01:07,960
And you are...

19
00:01:09,280 --> 00:01:12,440
I'm the sponsor of this competition

20
00:01:12,680 --> 00:01:14,840
and the head of Wending Group,

21
00:01:14,960 --> 00:01:15,760
Feng Shu.

22
00:01:16,480 --> 00:01:19,039
Congratulations on advancing
to the finals in first place.

23
00:01:19,039 --> 00:01:21,770
I look forward to
your performance in the finals.

24
00:01:22,400 --> 00:01:23,530
Thank you, Mr. Feng.

25
00:01:23,840 --> 00:01:25,840
I'm thrilled to make it to the finals.

26
00:01:25,840 --> 00:01:28,440
I will work hard over the next week

27
00:01:28,680 --> 00:01:30,160
and strive to surprise the judges

28
00:01:30,160 --> 00:01:31,640
in the finals.

29
00:01:40,800 --> 00:01:41,600
Ms. Shen.

30
00:01:51,800 --> 00:01:55,840
With your dedication
and professionalism in dance,

31
00:01:56,200 --> 00:01:58,840
you totally deserve a championship trophy.

32
00:01:59,960 --> 00:02:00,720
But

33
00:02:01,200 --> 00:02:03,120
you know, the competition

34
00:02:03,760 --> 00:02:05,000
is fierce.

35
00:02:06,280 --> 00:02:07,880
So sometimes,

36
00:02:07,880 --> 00:02:09,199
this competition

37
00:02:09,479 --> 00:02:12,680
is not just about dancing skills.

38
00:02:13,480 --> 00:02:14,480
It's more about

39
00:02:14,760 --> 00:02:16,160
a person's temper,

40
00:02:16,440 --> 00:02:17,200
character,

41
00:02:17,640 --> 00:02:18,640
and even destiny.

42
00:02:21,480 --> 00:02:22,640
Sorry, Mr. Feng.

43
00:02:23,640 --> 00:02:25,840
I don't quite understand what you mean.

44
00:02:26,440 --> 00:02:28,370
Why don't you just say it straight?

45
00:02:29,640 --> 00:02:30,640
Don't mention it.

46
00:02:31,440 --> 00:02:33,560
Kids nowadays mature so early.

47
00:02:33,880 --> 00:02:34,760
Just yesterday,

48
00:02:34,760 --> 00:02:36,440
a 16-year-old girl

49
00:02:36,440 --> 00:02:38,200
came to me and said,

50
00:02:38,280 --> 00:02:40,040
even though she dances averagely,

51
00:02:40,040 --> 00:02:41,960
she just wants to win the championship.

52
00:02:41,960 --> 00:02:44,240
She is willing to give her all.

53
00:02:46,400 --> 00:02:47,640
Only 16 years old.

54
00:02:47,760 --> 00:02:50,760
I don't know who she learned it from
at such a young age.

55
00:02:50,880 --> 00:02:52,880
Just for a championship trophy,

56
00:02:53,240 --> 00:02:55,280
she is willing to give everything.

57
00:02:55,600 --> 00:02:56,480
Including...

58
00:03:01,680 --> 00:03:03,160
But on second thought,

59
00:03:04,280 --> 00:03:05,440
this competition

60
00:03:06,080 --> 00:03:08,400
is all about being worthy of the name.

61
00:03:09,040 --> 00:03:13,570
Only when someone like you wins the
championship can it be called well-deserved,

62
00:03:14,000 --> 00:03:14,600
right?

63
00:03:15,360 --> 00:03:16,840
Thank you, Mr. Feng.

64
00:03:18,040 --> 00:03:19,040
I will work hard.

65
00:03:19,040 --> 00:03:19,720
How?

66
00:03:26,840 --> 00:03:27,560
Alright,

67
00:03:28,160 --> 00:03:28,840
no rush.

68
00:03:30,200 --> 00:03:31,930
I left my business card for you.

69
00:03:37,440 --> 00:03:39,360
The opportunity is right in front of you.

70
00:03:39,360 --> 00:03:40,400
Think about it.

71
00:04:13,320 --> 00:04:13,800
Shen Xi,

72
00:04:14,240 --> 00:04:14,900
you're out.

73
00:04:19,560 --> 00:04:20,920
This...

74
00:04:23,080 --> 00:04:25,340
this is the bouquet from the organizers.

75
00:04:25,440 --> 00:04:27,170
It looks like it's been reused.

76
00:04:28,640 --> 00:04:30,440
Your flowers are much prettier.

77
00:04:31,400 --> 00:04:32,480
Smells so good.

78
00:04:32,480 --> 00:04:33,409
Glad you like it.

79
00:04:33,720 --> 00:04:34,760
Put this coat on.

80
00:04:34,880 --> 00:04:35,940
Don't catch a cold.

81
00:04:37,800 --> 00:04:38,800
Not bad, Ms. Shen.

82
00:04:39,680 --> 00:04:42,000
I heard from the contestants
who just came out

83
00:04:42,000 --> 00:04:43,800
that the championship is yours.

84
00:04:44,040 --> 00:04:44,970
So outstanding.

85
00:04:47,000 --> 00:04:49,400
Once you get the prize money,

86
00:04:49,600 --> 00:04:51,040
plus my script

87
00:04:51,040 --> 00:04:52,480
and you as the female lead,

88
00:04:52,480 --> 00:04:54,080
it'll be hard not to succeed.

89
00:04:56,880 --> 00:04:58,280
I just wrote a new plot.

90
00:04:58,400 --> 00:04:59,360
Let me read it to you.

91
00:04:59,360 --> 00:05:00,160
Sure.

92
00:05:02,840 --> 00:05:04,080
Come on, get in.

93
00:05:17,040 --> 00:05:19,240
I came up with a highly difficult spin.

94
00:05:19,680 --> 00:05:20,480
It's a bit challenging.

95
00:05:20,480 --> 00:05:21,120
But if we pull it off,

96
00:05:21,120 --> 00:05:22,880
the audience will be shocked.

97
00:05:23,240 --> 00:05:24,440
Speechless.

98
00:05:25,040 --> 00:05:27,040
Then comes a tidal wave of applause.

99
00:05:28,120 --> 00:05:29,450
The applause is for you,

100
00:05:29,640 --> 00:05:30,640
and for me too.

101
00:05:31,160 --> 00:05:33,200
But ultimately, it's for you.

102
00:05:33,880 --> 00:05:35,680
You're the lead actress
of this dance drama,

103
00:05:35,680 --> 00:05:36,920
and more importantly, the investor.

104
00:05:36,920 --> 00:05:37,880
Without you,

105
00:05:38,159 --> 00:05:40,000
this dance drama wouldn't exist,

106
00:05:40,000 --> 00:05:41,800
and there wouldn't be this memorable,

107
00:05:41,800 --> 00:05:42,920
great moment.

108
00:05:46,960 --> 00:05:47,680
Ms. Shen,

109
00:05:48,080 --> 00:05:50,400
what are you thinking
about so absent-mindedly?

110
00:05:50,400 --> 00:05:51,659
Do you think it's good?

111
00:05:53,159 --> 00:05:54,159
It's pretty good.

112
00:05:55,200 --> 00:05:56,840
I knew you'd like it.

113
00:05:58,280 --> 00:06:01,210
Once we win the championship
and get the prize money,

114
00:06:01,560 --> 00:06:03,560
I'll take you to get
custom costumes first.

115
00:06:03,560 --> 00:06:04,800
They must be luxurious

116
00:06:04,800 --> 00:06:05,680
and beautiful.

117
00:06:06,320 --> 00:06:07,380
We'll buy two sets.

118
00:06:07,800 --> 00:06:08,930
One for performing,

119
00:06:09,520 --> 00:06:10,720
and one for sleeping.

120
00:06:12,120 --> 00:06:13,000
All right,

121
00:06:13,160 --> 00:06:14,160
Director Song.

122
00:06:14,760 --> 00:06:15,720
Just drive.

123
00:06:39,680 --> 00:06:42,840
Thank you all for coming
to my dance drama.

124
00:06:44,880 --> 00:06:47,080
I'd like to thank one person here,

125
00:06:47,680 --> 00:06:49,840
my love, Shen Xi.

126
00:06:51,840 --> 00:06:54,000
She stayed by my side

127
00:06:54,000 --> 00:06:55,400
during my hardest times.

128
00:06:56,880 --> 00:06:59,480
She also won the dance competition

129
00:06:59,480 --> 00:07:01,000
and got the prize money,

130
00:07:01,280 --> 00:07:03,480
making this dance drama possible.

131
00:07:04,840 --> 00:07:06,280
Here I want to say,

132
00:07:07,120 --> 00:07:08,240
Shen Xi,

133
00:07:09,840 --> 00:07:11,000
will you marry me?

134
00:07:22,040 --> 00:07:23,360
So sometimes,

135
00:07:23,520 --> 00:07:24,800
this competition

136
00:07:24,960 --> 00:07:28,400
is about more than just dance skills.

137
00:07:29,040 --> 00:07:29,960
It's more about

138
00:07:30,520 --> 00:07:32,040
a person's temper,

139
00:07:32,159 --> 00:07:34,440
character, and even destiny.

140
00:07:34,840 --> 00:07:35,770
Just yesterday,

141
00:07:35,920 --> 00:07:37,640
a 16-year-old girl

142
00:07:37,640 --> 00:07:39,000
came up to me and said

143
00:07:39,360 --> 00:07:41,120
that although her dancing is average,

144
00:07:41,120 --> 00:07:43,320
she's willing to give her all

145
00:07:43,480 --> 00:07:45,600
to win a championship.

146
00:07:49,840 --> 00:07:51,570
The opportunity is right here.

147
00:07:51,640 --> 00:07:52,640
Think it through.

148
00:09:54,000 --> 00:09:54,720
Shen Xi,

149
00:09:54,800 --> 00:09:56,320
call 120 for an ambulance!

150
00:09:56,320 --> 00:09:57,120
Shen Xi!

151
00:09:57,280 --> 00:09:58,800
Everyone, quiet! Are you okay?

152
00:09:58,800 --> 00:10:00,640
Step back. Everyone, step back.

153
00:10:01,040 --> 00:10:01,560
Shen Xi!

154
00:10:01,800 --> 00:10:04,400
Hello, this is
Checheng City Cultural Palace.

155
00:10:12,800 --> 00:10:14,200
That's the current situation.

156
00:10:14,200 --> 00:10:17,060
We're following the ambulance
to the hospital now.

157
00:10:17,520 --> 00:10:19,250
We'll keep each other updated.

158
00:10:21,000 --> 00:10:24,120
Captain Li,
I have a bad feeling about this.

159
00:10:24,720 --> 00:10:26,360
Stop beating around the bush. Speak.

160
00:10:26,360 --> 00:10:27,920
Judging from the toxicology and forensics

161
00:10:27,920 --> 00:10:29,840
I learned at the police academy,

162
00:10:29,840 --> 00:10:32,100
her symptoms highly suggest poisoning.

163
00:10:32,120 --> 00:10:33,320
When I checked,

164
00:10:33,480 --> 00:10:35,880
her pupils were constricted to pinpoints.

165
00:10:36,200 --> 00:10:37,360
That's one of the typical signs

166
00:10:37,360 --> 00:10:39,600
of organophosphate pesticide poisoning.

167
00:10:39,600 --> 00:10:41,600
But as for what exactly she drank,

168
00:10:41,600 --> 00:10:42,560
it's hard for me

169
00:10:42,920 --> 00:10:44,280
to tell right now.

170
00:10:49,960 --> 00:10:51,160
The patient's blood pressure is dropping.

171
00:10:51,160 --> 00:10:52,240
Systolic 60.

172
00:10:52,280 --> 00:10:53,280
Diastolic 30.

173
00:10:53,560 --> 00:10:55,160
Epinephrine, 1 mg IV push.

174
00:11:21,800 --> 00:11:24,120
Time of death, 1:47.

175
00:11:31,800 --> 00:11:32,800
Doctor,

176
00:11:33,000 --> 00:11:34,120
how is my daughter?

177
00:11:34,520 --> 00:11:36,080
The dose she drank was too high.

178
00:11:36,080 --> 00:11:37,880
We did everything we could. I'm sorry.

179
00:11:37,880 --> 00:11:41,480
My daughter...

180
00:11:45,160 --> 00:11:47,120
If it's phosphide poisoning,

181
00:11:47,720 --> 00:11:50,180
it couldn't have been ingested
too long ago.

182
00:11:50,400 --> 00:11:52,330
The cup used before going on stage.

183
00:12:01,320 --> 00:12:02,560
This looks like

184
00:12:02,640 --> 00:12:03,840
Shen Xi's cup.

185
00:12:09,160 --> 00:12:09,960
Evidence bag.

186
00:12:23,600 --> 00:12:25,130
Who is Officer Li Xingchen?

187
00:12:26,400 --> 00:12:27,040
I am.

188
00:12:27,600 --> 00:12:29,440
This was found on the girl.

189
00:12:29,640 --> 00:12:31,570
Take a look at what's written on it.

190
00:12:31,720 --> 00:12:33,240
It was likely left for you on purpose.

191
00:12:33,240 --> 00:12:34,600
I'll hand it over to you.

192
00:13:03,640 --> 00:13:04,840
Officer Li Xingchen,

193
00:13:06,600 --> 00:13:07,240
hello.

194
00:13:08,960 --> 00:13:10,640
By the time you get this player

195
00:13:11,960 --> 00:13:13,800
and hear this recording,

196
00:13:15,520 --> 00:13:17,650
we'll probably be separated by death.

197
00:13:19,840 --> 00:13:20,760
Thank you

198
00:13:22,360 --> 00:13:24,640
for trusting me

199
00:13:25,600 --> 00:13:27,400
after all your investigations.

200
00:13:28,120 --> 00:13:29,360
But I'm sorry,

201
00:13:31,320 --> 00:13:32,640
I failed your trust.

202
00:13:35,680 --> 00:13:36,840
You are a good cop.

203
00:13:38,280 --> 00:13:39,160
So,

204
00:13:41,160 --> 00:13:42,760
I'm turning myself in to you.

205
00:13:46,040 --> 00:13:48,080
Where should I begin?

206
00:13:51,280 --> 00:13:52,840
Actually,

207
00:13:53,840 --> 00:13:55,680
I've already told you most of it.

208
00:13:57,280 --> 00:13:58,320
Let's start from

209
00:14:00,000 --> 00:14:01,530
before the competition...

210
00:14:02,800 --> 00:14:05,730
Let me start from when I got
Feng Shu's business card.

211
00:14:12,280 --> 00:14:14,480
Ms. Shen, you really are smart.

212
00:14:14,960 --> 00:14:16,160
You catch on quickly.

213
00:14:16,680 --> 00:14:17,760
Exactly.

214
00:14:17,880 --> 00:14:19,680
A wise person knows how to adapt.

215
00:14:21,320 --> 00:14:22,650
I've heard all about it.

216
00:14:22,840 --> 00:14:23,960
This bonus

217
00:14:24,560 --> 00:14:26,020
is quite important to you.

218
00:14:29,200 --> 00:14:30,800
Come on, don't be nervous.

219
00:14:31,760 --> 00:14:32,690
Have some water.

220
00:14:48,600 --> 00:14:49,520
What?

221
00:14:50,120 --> 00:14:51,360
You're already here,

222
00:14:52,320 --> 00:14:54,380
and you won't even have a sip of water?

223
00:15:16,360 --> 00:15:17,760
I need to make some things

224
00:15:21,400 --> 00:15:22,920
clear to you first.

225
00:15:25,960 --> 00:15:26,840
I understand.

226
00:15:28,520 --> 00:15:29,580
If I sleep with you,

227
00:15:31,400 --> 00:15:34,330
you'll give me the championship
and the prize money,

228
00:15:34,840 --> 00:15:35,640
right?

229
00:15:37,560 --> 00:15:39,320
Yes,

230
00:15:39,480 --> 00:15:40,360
exactly.

231
00:15:40,360 --> 00:15:41,840
You're absolutely right.

232
00:15:46,680 --> 00:15:47,720
Close your eyes.

233
